    <string name="help_text">How does the streak work?\nStudy every day to add consecutive days. If you skip a day, the streak resets, unless you have a streak protector.\n\nWhat are gems for?\nYou earn them by completing lessons and challenges. You can spend them in the store on streak protectors and XP boosters.\n\nWhat is XP?\nExperience points you earn by studying. They help you level up and see your weekly progress.\n\nIs my data saved offline?\nYou can view the last data you loaded without internet. You need a connection to save changes.</string>
    <string name="terms_text">By using Lumi you accept these terms.\n\n1. Lumi is a study support app: it organizes subjects, tasks and sessions.\n2. You are responsible for the information you enter and for keeping your password secret.\n3. Rewards (XP, gems and store items) have no monetary value and can\'t be exchanged for money.\n4. We may update these terms; we\'ll let you know inside the app.\n\nThis text is provisional and must be reviewed by the team before the app is published.</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">What data we store\nYour name, email, time zone and what you enter in the app: subjects, tasks, materials, study sessions and progress.\n\nWhat we use it for\nTo show your information on any device and calculate your progress.\n\nGoogle Calendar\nIf you connect your calendar, Lumi only reads and creates events with your permission. You can revoke it from your Google account.\n\nYour rights\nYou can edit your profile or request deletion of your account and data from Settings.\n\nThis text is provisional and must be reviewed by the team before the app is published.</string>
    <string name="credits_text">Lumi was built with the help of these tools:\n\n• Fredoka font, SIL Open Font License.\n• Jetpack Compose and Material 3, by Google.\n• Retrofit and OkHttp, by Square.\n• Room, by Google.\n• Google Calendar API.\n\nThanks to everyone who tested the app and gave their feedback.</string>
    <string name="delete_account_text">We\'ll request the deletion of your account and all your data. This action can\'t be undone.</string>
